## Code Example

```javascript
function computeShare(ckne) {
  const sum = ckne.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0);
  if (sum === 0) return ckne.map(()=>1/ckne.length);
  return ckne.map(v => Math.max(0.01, v / sum));
}
